{"unit_id":"Hongjun1-RGB__dsh-phone-access#card-zh","repo":"Hongjun1-RGB/dsh-phone-access","commit":"37dbae012f9244bead315ed69491a5f300946810","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-phone-access（DSH 插件，web 客户端）：把当前 DSH 会话临时开放给手机浏览器访问。插件在本机代理 DSH 的 HTTP 与 WebSocket 流量，并启动 Cloudflare Quick Tunnel；界面提供访问开关、状态显示和推送设置。它还能在隧道地址变化时重建隧道并推送新地址，支持配置 Server酱、WxPusher、pushplus 或 webhook。适合需要从手机继续使用桌面 DSH 会话的用户；首次使用若本机没有 cloudflared，插件会下载对应平台版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:215-330","lib/index.js:332-370","lib/index.js:603-711","ui/ui.js:213-286"]}
{"unit_id":"Hongjun1-RGB__dsh-phone-access#card-en","repo":"Hongjun1-RGB/dsh-phone-access","commit":"37dbae012f9244bead315ed69491a5f300946810","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-phone-access opens the current DSH session to a phone browser through a temporary Cloudflare tunnel. It adds a web interface toggle, runs a local HTTP and WebSocket proxy, and can send updated tunnel links through push services. If cloudflared is missing, it downloads a platform binary.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:215-330","lib/index.js:332-370","lib/index.js:603-711","ui/ui.js:213-286"]}
